{"metadata":{"description":"Resource-aware multi-agent orchestration for Codex and DeepSeek Harness (All in Flash DSH plugin)","id":"gh:1321408361","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"allinluna","slug":"zenx0x/allinluna","topics":["agent-orchestration","agent-skills","ai-agents","allinflash","codex","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","luna","multi-agent","orchestration"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Resource-aware multi-agent orchestration for Codex and DeepSeek Harness (All in Flash DSH plugin)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# All in Luna"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Stop running an entire project inside one AI conversation.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Give All in Luna one big goal."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"It turns the work into independent top-level tasks: **run what can run in parallel, wait only on rea"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"l dependencies, keep each task's context separate, and bring the results back together.**"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Each task can still use its own subagents, tools, Skills, or MCPs."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Parallel across tasks. Recursive inside tasks.**"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Why does this exist?"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Small AI coding tasks are easy."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The hard part looks more like this:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> “Refactor authentication end to end, including the backend, frontend, migration, tests, and docume"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"or authentication end to end, including the backend, frontend, migration, tests, and documentation.”"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"At first, everything is fine."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then the agent reads files, edits code, runs tests, starts subagents, handles failures, reads more f"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"iles, and keeps pushing more execution detail back into the same conversation."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"After enough turns, familiar problems appear:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- the context keeps growing;
- unrelated work starts contaminating other work;
- earlier constraints"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" become easier to forget;
- one local blocker stalls the whole flow;
- subagent results become harde"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"r to manage;
- a new conversation has to reconstruct what really happened;
- the agent says “done,” "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"but the outcome may not actually be complete."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**All in Luna starts from one simple idea: one conversation should not have to carry an entire proje"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" in Luna starts from one simple idea: one conversation should not have to carry an entire project.**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## One more layer above subagents"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"A typical agent workflow looks like this:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"All in Luna adds a real **Top-level Task** layer above local workers:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**A Top-level Task is not just another subagent.**"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"It is an independent work domain with its own goal, context, dependencies, working state, local exec"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ution process, and result boundary."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"A subagent is a local worker a Task may use when that Task needs to split its own work further."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"> **All in Luna does not replace subagents. It gives them a better place to live.**"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"# What you get"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## 1. Real top-level tasks"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"A large goal can become independent work domains instead of temporary chat branches."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"For example:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Each task can move independently, wait on dependencies, produce results, and keep its own working co"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ask can move independently, wait on dependencies, produce results, and keep its own working context."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## 2. Parallel when possible"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Independent work does not need to queue behind unrelated work."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"**One blocked task doesn't freeze unrelated work.**"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## 3. Separate working contexts"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Backend debugging does not need to share one giant context with frontend changes, test logs, documen"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"tation, and release work."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Your main conversation should mostly see:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"File reads, terminal output, test logs, diffs, and implementation detail can stay with the Task that"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"minal output, test logs, diffs, and implementation detail can stay with the Task that produced them."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Your main conversation does not need to become the project's log file.**"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## 4. Recursive local workers"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"A Top-level Task can still split into WorkUnits or use local subagents when it is complex on its own"},{"id":"p44s2","text":" Top-level Task can still split into WorkUnits or use local subagents when it is complex on its own."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Local complexity stays local."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"**Parallel across tasks. Recursive inside tasks.**"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"## 5. Resume instead of restarting"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"All in Luna persists run state, task state, dependencies, and results."},{"id":"p50s1","text":"Long-running work does not have to remain attached to one ever-growing conversation."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"Completed work does not have to be rediscovered from chat history."},{"id":"p53s1","text":"## 6. Verify before “done”"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"An agent saying:"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"> “Done.”"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"is not the same as the task actually being complete."},{"id":"p57s1","text":"All in Luna can check tests, builds, changed files, artifacts, and declared outputs before accepting"},{"id":"p57s2","text":" a task as complete."},{"id":"p58s1","text":"## 7. Bring your own workflow"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"All in Luna is not one fixed workflow."},{"id":"p60s1","text":"Use the default delivery path for ordinary software work."},{"id":"p61s1","text":"Use **GSD** inside a Task when you want a more explicit development workflow."},{"id":"p62s1","text":"Connect **Research Routes** for research-oriented work."},{"id":"p63s1","text":"Tasks can also use other Skills, MCPs, tools, and host capabilities."},{"id":"p64s1","text":"**The Core runs complex work. It does not dictate how every task must think.**"},{"id":"p65s1","text":"# Example"},{"id":"p66s1","text":"Suppose you say:"},{"id":"p67s1","text":"> **“Refactor this application's authentication system, including backend, frontend, migration, and "},{"id":"p67s2","text":"ctor this application's authentication system, including backend, frontend, migration, and tests.”**"},{"id":"p68s1","text":"All in Luna can organize it as:"},{"id":"p69s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p70s1","text":"Task 1 and Task 2 can move at the same time."},{"id":"p71s1","text":"Task 1 can still use its own subagents if needed."},{"id":"p72s1","text":"Task 3 waits only for the result it actually depends on."},{"id":"p73s1","text":"You do not have to follow the complete implementation history of all four tasks in one conversation."},{"id":"p74s1","text":"# When should I use it?"},{"id":"p75s1","text":"All in Luna is a good fit for:"},{"id":"p76s1","text":"- large features;
- work spanning frontend / backend / tests / docs;
- major refactors;
- migrations"},{"id":"p76s2","text":";
- several outcomes that can move independently;
- long-running coding sessions;
- work where one b"},{"id":"p76s3","text":"locker should not stop the whole project;
- tasks that need different tools, models, or workflows;
-"},{"id":"p76s4","text":" work you want to resume instead of reconstructing from chat history."},{"id":"p77s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p78s1","text":"### What about Sol Advisor?"},{"id":"p79s1","text":"Sol Advisor-style systems are closer to:"},{"id":"p80s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p81s1","text":"All in Luna moves the orchestration boundary one level higher:"},{"id":"p82s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p83s1","text":"They focus on different abstraction layers rather than being simple substitutes."}],"truncated":true}
